card.statement:
For $i\in I_\circ$, the action of $b_i$ on $V_{l,x}$ or $V^*_{l,x}$ is given by

\begin{align*}
b_iv_{\alpha}&=x^{-\delta_{i,0}}[\alpha_i]v_{\alpha-\eb_i+\eb_{i+1}}
-x^{\delta_{i,0}+\delta_{i,1}+\delta_{i,-1}}q^{-1}\gamma_i[\alpha_{i+2}]
v_{\alpha+\eb_{i-1}-\eb_{i+2}},\\
b_iv^*_{\alpha}&=x^{\delta_{i,0}}[\alpha_{i+1}]v^*_{\alpha+\eb_i-\eb_{i+1}}
-x^{-\delta_{i,0}-\delta_{i,1}-\delta_{i,-1}}q^{-1}\gamma_i[\alpha_{i-1}]
v^*_{\alpha-\eb_{i-1}+\eb_{i+2}}.
\end{align*}
